{"product_id":"old-school","title":"Old school","description":"\u003cp\u003eOld School gives readers a view from the paddock of Hindmarsh's record-breaking career at Parramatta, and chronicles the dizzying highs of playing for your club, state and country and the heartbreaking lows of grand final defeats. Hindmarsh reveals the joys of marriage and fatherhood, and of playing for and captaining the club he loves, but also covers with unflinching honesty the personal issues that he has struggled with off the field.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Nathan Hindmarsh\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781742611662\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 303\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 0 x 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750663823513,"sku":"3RC9781742611662","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/old-school-971609.jpg?v=1694791179","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/old-school","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}